WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio Description for the FF8 New Game Intro FMV (disc00_30h.avi).
This FMV plays after the player selects "New Game" from the title screen.
It features the ocean, Rinoa in a flower field, and the iconic Squall vs Seifer duel.
Music: "Liberi Fatali" (orchestral choir piece).
Estimated duration: ~3:12.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Fade in from black. Gentle ocean waves come into view under a blue sky with scattered clouds.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Waves roll rhythmically onto a smooth, pale sandy beach. The camera slowly pans across the shoreline as surf washes forward and recedes.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The ocean stretches to the horizon, sunlight glinting off the water's surface. The waves continue their steady pulse against the sand.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.800
White text appears over the ocean, the words floating ethereally: "I'll be here..."

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.800
The camera races forward across the water. The word "Why?" streaks across the ocean's surface.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.000
The ocean surface transforms into a vast, cracked desert stretching to the horizon under a hazy sky.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.400
The camera sweeps across the sun-baked desert. Text appears: "I'll be waiting... here..."

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.400
Rinoa stands with her back to the camera in a lush field of yellow and white flowers swaying in the breeze. Text reads: "For what?"

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.500
A closer view of Rinoa in the flower field, her dark hair blowing gently. Text appears: "I'll be here... Why...?"

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.600
Close-up of Rinoa's hand as pink flower petals drift past. She slowly opens her palm, revealing nothing — then a soft glow appears.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:08.600
A white feather materializes in her palm, glowing softly with warm light. It lifts gently from her hand and begins to float upward.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:20.000
The feather rises into dark, swirling storm clouds. Pink petals spiral around it as it ascends into an increasingly turbulent sky.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
The storm clouds churn violently. The feather continues to rise, surrounded by whirling debris and energy. Lightning flashes illuminate the darkness.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
The screen clears to reveal a title card on a dark background: "SQUARESOFT presents."

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.600
A gunblade — a sword with a revolver mechanism built into the hilt — drops from above and slams point-first into cracked stone. A black-gloved hand reaches down and grips the handle.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:42.000
Rapid montage: white feathers flood the screen. Quick flashes of faces and motion — glimpses of characters amid swirling feathers and light.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.000
More rapid cuts through the feather storm: a woman's silhouette, flowing fabric, intense eyes glimpsed between cascading white feathers.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:51.600
Sorceress Edea appears in her ornate horned headdress and dark robes, her face regal and menacing. Rinoa turns amid blowing feathers, her expression searching.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:59.000
The feathers dissolve into a stormy sky. The scene shifts to a desolate rocky plateau — a barren battlefield of cracked stone and grey clouds.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.800
Seifer Almasy — blond, wearing a grey trench coat — strides confidently forward and swings his gunblade, the Hyperion, in a wide sweeping arc. He smirks.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:10.400
Seifer faces the camera and raises one hand, beckoning with his fingers — taunting his opponent to come forward. His expression is cocky and challenging.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.000
Wide shot of the barren plateau. Squall Leonhart — brown-haired, wearing a black leather jacket with a white fur collar — charges forward from the opposite side.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.000
The two young men rush together at full speed. Their gunblades crash together in a shower of orange sparks, the impact echoing across the empty landscape.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.200
Rapid intercuts: a flash of Edea's piercing eyes, Rinoa's anxious gaze, then back to the duel as sparks fly from clashing steel.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.600
Close-up of the two gunblades locked together, metal grinding against metal. Both fighters strain, pushing against each other with all their strength.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:30.000
Seifer forces Squall back. Squall stumbles, jaw clenched in determination, then recovers his footing and counter-attacks.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.600
The two exchange a flurry of strikes. Their blades clash repeatedly as they circle each other on the rocky ground.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:39.800
Seifer extends his left hand and casts a fire spell — a blast of orange flame erupts from his palm and strikes Squall directly, sending him staggering.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:46.000
Squall lies on the cracked stone, grimacing in pain. Blood trickles down the left side of his face. He grits his teeth and slowly forces himself to rise.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Quick montage: Rinoa's pendant gleams at her throat. Edea's cold, calculating eyes fill the screen. Rinoa reaches through a storm of swirling white feathers.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.600
Warm golden overlays: Rinoa and Edea appear superimposed over one another in rapid flashes, their images merging and separating.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.600
Squall rises to his feet, blood streaming down his face. He raises his gunblade, the Revolver, and charges at Seifer with a desperate upward slash.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.000
The slash connects — a diagonal cut across Seifer's face from his forehead to his nose. Blood sprays as Seifer recoils. Both men now bear matching scars.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.400
Rinoa and Squall step toward each other against a brilliantly glowing white sky. They reach for each other. The image cuts to black.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:12.000
The Final Fantasy VIII logo appears against a white background — the silhouette of Squall and Rinoa embracing, surrounded by ornate wings and filigree. The logo fades to black.
